  "task2_weighted_f1_proof": {
    "mathematical_principle": "When all evaluated classes in a dataset have identical ground-truth support (s_k = N/K for all k), the class weights w_k = s_k / N simplify identically to 1/K. Therefore, Weighted F1 = sum(w_k * F1_k) = (1/K) * sum(F1_k) = Macro F1. This is a mathematical identity that holds whenever class support is balanced.",
